contribute fully to Loyalist College’s mission and vision and each person’s contribution will be respected.
We will act in accordance with our guiding values which include respect, integrity and transparency.
Loyalist College will promote education, increased awareness and prompt action as the most effective
mechanisms for preventing harassment and discrimination as defined in this policy and will not tolerate
or condone harassment or discrimination should it occur.
All concerns and complaints related to harassment and/or discrimination will be addressed in a manner
that is timely, facilitative and fair with due regard to confidentiality.
