Strategy
March 2023 – March 2025
Introduction
Loyalist College (Loyalist) stewards data derived from a wide range of sources including applied research
partnerships, scholarly research projects and personal and academic data about our past, current, and
potential students, staff, faculty and partners.  It is our responsibility to ensure that this data is fully
governed, ethically managed, and well understood. In addition, as a research partner in Canada’s public
education system, it is important that we contribute to the broader knowledge ecosystem, which will
include research findings and data. To do so, we must take every measure to implement and maintain a
robust data governance strategy for all types of data in our care. 
