4. If the complaint is determined to not fall within the scope of this Code but may fall within the
scope of another College policy, the Complainant will be advised accordingly and instructed to
consult the relevant policy(ies).
5. If the complaint is determined to not fall within the scope of this Code, the complaint will not
proceed.
6. The Vice-President, Student Life and Leadership will normally provide the person/people named in
the complaint with a summary of the complaint.
7. It is a breach this Code to retaliate against someone who reports a complaint.
8. It is a breach of this Code to make a false or unfounded complaint with malicious or frivolous
intent.
9. Anonymous complaints will not be processed.
