This website provides quick access to the information contained in the College’s Sexual Assault and
Sexual Violence Policy and Protocol. The Policy and Protocol provides procedures and resources to
support individuals and groups who may be directly or indirectly involved in working with persons who
have experienced sexual violence.
I urge all members of the College community to review the Policy and Protocol to learn about options and
resources available to those who require support or who wish to support others. Please help to ensure
that the College remains a safe and positive space where members of the College community feel able to
work, learn and express themselves in a safe and respectful environment.
