ADMIN 125 Procedure for Responding to Sexual Assault and Sexualized Violence – Students
ADMIN 125 Procedure for Responding to Sexual Misconduct, Sexualized Assaults, and Sexualized
Violence – Employees
Appendix A: ADMIN 125 Responding to Sexual Assault and Sexualized Violence Form
Mark Kirkpatrick
President and CEO
Loyalist College
In accordance with Ministry requirements, Loyalist College reports annually to its Board of Governors on
sexual assault and sexualized violence education and disclosures. A copy of the annual report to the
Board is available by contacting Andrea Paradise, Executive Assistant to the Board of Governors, at
