Fit to Learn
1.       Introduction 
As part of our commitment to Health and Wellness, Loyalist College is focused on proactively creating a
culture of wellness for the betterment of students, staff and faculty. This includes providing a safe,
healthy and productive learning environment for the entire College community. It is the expectation that
students at Loyalist College will not use impairing substances – legal or illegal – while on campus to
negatively affect their ability to learn or participate in activities safely, competently and efficiently.
