7.       Privacy and Confidentiality
Medical information provided by the students and his/her care providers is not shared beyond what is
necessary.
8.       Non-Compliance
Impairment while in the learning environment and false reporting are examples of violations of this
policy, consequences of which may follow the College’s progressive discipline process, up to and
including expulsion.
