Please note:
1. This form is for complaints against students under the Loyalist College Student Code of Conduct
2. Any member of the College community (student, staff, faculty) may bring a complaint under this
Code against a student for non-academic misbehaviour.
3. A complaint under this Code must be filed with the Vice-President, Student Life and Leadership, or
Designate, within thirty (30) days of the alleged violation of the Code unless the Vice-President,
