6. Application & Scope 
The Loyalist College Student Code of Conduct applies to the non-academic conduct of all full- 
and part-time Loyalist College students that occurs on-campus; in properties owned or leased 
by Loyalist College; when using College equipment or software; or when participating in Loyalist 
College activities regardless of whether they take place on-or-off-campus. Complaints involving 
