7.1 Student Rights 
• The right to pursue their academic program with all the access and privileges that the 
College accords to those in good standing. 
• The right to participate fully in College life without fear or threat of harassment, 
intimidation, discrimination, violence, or other forms of exclusionary or threatening 
behaviour. 
