Administrative Move/Relocation – In some situations, particularly if the Complainant and the 
Respondent are in the Loyalist residence community, there may be a need to move a student to 
another room or to another residence. This will often be linked to a sanction restricting the 
person’s ability to return to their previous residence building. 
 
Likewise, in cases where a Complainant and Respondent may be in the same courses or 
program, there may be a need to move a student to another course or another program cohort. 
 
Alcohol Probation – Students who create a disturbance after, or because of, drinking or who 
violate rules and regulations after, or because of, drinking, or who demonstrate signs of 
problem drinking may be placed on alcohol probation. Students on such probation are not 
