Fines – A fine is a financial charge against a student’s account in consequence of a breach of 
this Code and to hold a student accountable for such breach. 
 
Interim Measures – In cases where the Vice-President, Student Life and Leadership, or 
Designate, deems it necessary, interim measures may be implemented. Such measures are 
taken as the result of a reasonable belief in the need to protect the safety and well-being of the 
