J. Student Code of Conduct Complaints Review Panel Composition 
1. The full membership of the Student Code of Conduct Complaints Review Panel consists of 
two students, two faculty members and two staff members (one administrative staff 
member and one support staff member) appointed by the Vice-President, Student Life and 
Leadership. 
2. Student Code of Conduct Complaints Review Panel Terms of Service: 
i. 
