non-academic behaviour across Loyalist College’s diversified community. The Code provides a 
framework for review, investigation and resolution including sanctions, as appropriate. Where 
possible and appropriate, education and the provision of support services shall be used to 
attempt informal resolution of a matter before proceeding to formal resolution procedures. 
While this Code lays out specific avenues for Complaints and Appeals, the College encourages 
student to speak informally with the Vice-President, Student Life and Leadership, or Designate, 
to better understand their options before proceeding with a complaint or response. 
The administration of this Code and Loyalist College policies is to be conducted in a clear, fair, 
