Student: Refers to all full and part-time students, enrolled in for-credit or non-credit courses 
(and includes distance education courses) at Loyalist College or their guests on-campus or at a 
College related activity or event off-campus. 
 
4. Principles 
4.1  Positive Learning and Living Environment 
Loyalist College is committed to establishing and maintaining a positive learning and living 
environment. The Code is designed to provide an explicit definition of the minimum 
standards of personal conduct that Loyalist College expects of all its students.  
 
4.2  Conduct Respecting the Dignity and Worth of Every Member of the Loyalist College 
Community, Free from Discrimination 
