The procedures outlined in this document do not apply to breaches that are determined to be 
at Level 1 as outlined in Appendix I. Fines or other sanctions for such breaches shall be at the 
sole discretion of the relevant College representative, (e.g., residence staff member). Appeals of 
any such sanctions shall be to the immediate supervisor of the relevant staff member and the 
decision of the supervisor shall be final with no further avenue for appeal. 
Whenever appropriate, administration of this Code will seek to apply positive interventions, 
