6. The process will normally be concluded within 60 calendar days but may be extended 
should it be acceptable to all parties if the conditions noted in Appendix B are presented. 
7. The matter will be deemed to be resolved when the process comes to a natural end with 
the outcomes having been reasonably fulfilled, and all parties agreeing it has been 
reasonably resolved. 
8. A brief written summary will be provided by the Vice-President, Student Life and 
