No Contact Order – To safeguard the review and hearing process or to ensure a safe space for 
students involved in a complaint, the Vice-President, Student Life and Leadership, or Designate, 
may issue a No Contact Order. Such an order restricts, as outlined in the Order, any form of 
contact (which may also include matters covered under a No Communication Order) between 
students involved in the complaint process until such time as the matter has been resolved. 
 
Non-Academic Suspension – Students may be issued with a non-academic suspension which 
prohibits them from being on campus for any non-academic purpose. Except for classes, labs, 
