6. Normally, the Respondent has up to five business days to:   
i. meet with the Vice-President, Student Life and Leadership, or Designate; 
and,  
ii. submit a formal response, in writing, to the complaint.  
The response must be delivered to the Vice-President, Student Life and Leadership, either 
through the Loyalist College conductcomplaints@loyalistcollege.com address, campus mail, 
or by Express Post. 
In the case of a student-to-student complaint, if the Respondent believes the Complainant 
to be in violation of the Code, the Respondent may detail the nature of the violation(s) in 
