which students and faculty are treated with mutual respect. 
3.3.2 Faculty will ensure that all activities in the class are related to the stated learning outcomes for the
class or on the course outline. 
3.3.3 Faculty will refrain from using, or allowing class time to be used to, promote personal, religious,
political, social, or business agendas. This guideline is not intended to restrict academic freedom of
