Policy Number: AOP 202
Policy Title: Planned Cancellation of Classes
Supersedes Existing Policy? Y
Policy Owner: Senior Vice-President Academic
Associated Procedure: N
Date Last Approved by CET: February 17, 2021
1. Introduction and Purpose
 A timetable outlining the classes, times, room locations and delivery mode is provided to students at the
time of registration. If a class must be cancelled, students should be provided with adequate notice and
an explanation of how the class will be made up. 
2. Application
This policy applies to all classes offered by Loyalist College. It does not apply in cases of scheduled
campus closure or personal illness.
3. Policy Statement
