Academic Timetables
1. Introduction and Purpose 
Loyalist College is committed to providing students with a conflict-free timetable that respects the
Loyalist College Scheduling Principles, the faculty collective agreement and supports teaching and
learning.   
2. Application 
This policy applies to all instructional and other activity at the College campus. 
 3. Policy Statement 
