Program of Study Development, Renewal and Change
Policy
1. Introduction and Purpose 
Loyalist College is committed to offering a mix of relevant programs of study that meet student and
workforce needs that are supported by a rigorous quality assurance process.   
2. Application 
This policy applies to all programs of study offered by Loyalist College. 
3. Definitions  
 Academic Year: The period from September 1st to August 31st. 
