Students must comply with legislation regarding copyright, trademark, and licensing agreements. The
law applies on the intranet/internet as it does on paper. Students will not, for example, violate copyright
conditions specified on Loyalist College-owned software, texts, and/or any other materials subject to the
terms of this legislation.
Students who are not familiar with this legislation should clarify their responsibility with Loyalist College
