Integrity in Research and Scholarship
1. Introduction 
Loyalist College supports and encourages the highest standard of conduct in research and
scholarship. The primary responsibility for maintaining integrity and ethical conduct rests with all
individuals involved in such activities. 
The purpose of this policy is to ensure academic research and scholarship by members of the College
community are conducted with academic integrity, scientific rigour, honesty and transparency. 
