Applications must be accompanied by all necessary supporting documentation. 
Researchers are expected to include with their application documentation proving they have
completed the TCPS2 CORE tutorial. 
Researchers who wish to conduct research at more than one college must submit a multi-site
application to the REB of each institution and receive approval from each college before commencing
data collection. 
Types of REB reviews 
Applications may be submitted to the College Research Services Office at any time. The Research Services
