All other entities and offices at the College shall respect the independence, accountability, and authority
delegated to the REB and may not over-ride an REB decision to approve or reject a research proposal. 
The mandate of the REB is to review, approve, reject, propose modifications to, or terminate, any
proposed or ongoing research involving human participants conducted within the College, or by members
of the College. 
The REB conducts its review process using the consideration set forth in the Tri-Council Policy (TCPS2) as
a minimum standard. The REB website is located at: http://www.loyalistcollege.com/about-
loyalist/research-services/research-ethics-board/. 
Procedures 
