All full-time applicants to a post-secondary program.
3. Definitions
Academic year – Three (3) terms of study beginning in September and concluding in August of the
following year.
Course – An individual unit of instruction offered at a post-secondary institution.
Full-time post-secondary program – A sequence of courses leading to an Ontario College Credential
