Durham College’s Research Ethics Board will receive, review and respond to any researcher who Loyalist
College’s REB has refused approval, with the following conditions: 
1. The researcher has formally requested the initiation of the appeal process to the Loyalist College
REB. 
2. The researcher must re-submit an application to the Durham REB and adhere to their pre-
determined timelines for review. 
