4. PLAR Assessment Options
Skills Demonstration (OSCE) there may be fees attached. Please see individual programs for
associated costs. 
A student may be asked to perform a hands-on activity either pre-recorded or in person, created by
the College, to determine credit for prior learning. An interview with one or more assessors may
also be required either to set up the parameters of the skills demonstration, to explore more fully
