credit for prior learning. An interview with one or more assessors may also be required either to
set up the parameters of the written challenge exam, to explore more fully student responses on
the exam, or as a feedback mechanism after review. 
Challenge Exam – Oral 
A student may be asked to complete an oral challenge exam, created by the College, to determine
credit for prior learning. An interview with one or more assessors may also be required either to
set up the parameters of the oral challenge exam, to explore more fully student responses during
the exam, or as a feedback mechanism after review. 
Portfolio 
