Post-Secondary Registration and Graduation
1. Introduction and Purpose
The Post-Secondary Registration and Graduation policy does not supersede or negate any rights or
responsibilities provided by law, and does not seek to limit the rights or freedom of expression as
provided by law; however, behaviour that interferes with Loyalist’s operations, a student’s ability to learn
and successfully graduate, and/or the academic integrity of the institution, is unacceptable.
