Services will post final grades electronically through the MyLoyalist student portal.
6.2 Transcripts
Official transcripts provide a record of all courses attempted by a student. Enrolment Services will record
the student’s final course grades on the student’s official transcript. A grade of ‘CC’ represents a course
that continues to the next semester. The CC grade will be replaced with a final grade at the end of the
subsequent semester. Transcripts are available for students upon request through Enrolment Services.
The official transcript details a student’s permanent academic record at Loyalist and will carry the
Loyalist College seal and authorized signature. Students with outstanding fees or fines will be required
to pay their fees and/or fines in full prior to the release of official transcripts of credentials.
