the program of study and graduation requirements in place at the time of re-admission,
Students must have a 60% weighted cumulative program grade point average for non-degree
programs or 65% weighted cumulative program grade point average for degree programs,
Students must have taken a minimum of 25% of the program credits or courses (whichever is greater)
at Loyalist College to satisfy residency requirements,
Students must not have acquired more than 50% of their program credits through PLAR, and,
Students who interrupt their full-time studies will be required to meet the re-admission and program
requirements in effect at the time of their return to the College. Students who have interrupted their
