Official Transcript of Academic Record (or Certificate of Achievement, which lists only courses passed and
no GPA) bearing the College seal and signature of the Registrar may be released directly to another
education institution, employment agency, or an employer or prospective employer, only on the written
authority of the student/graduate.
Depending on the year of graduation, a fee may be charged for each transcript or certificate issued. See
