Admissions
1. Introduction and Purpose 
Loyalist is committed to providing educational opportunities and pathways for further studies for its
students.
The purpose of this policy is to provide a framework for admission to Loyalist’s full-time post-secondary
programs, including Ontario College Certificates, Diplomas, Advanced Diplomas, Graduate Certificates and
Degrees.
2. Application
All full-time applicants to a post-secondary program.
3. Definitions
