Admission is competitive and will be based on the applicant’s overall qualifications and the availability of
space in the program and in accordance with the Ministry of Colleges and Universities’ (MCU) policies.
Generally, there are three (3) full-time post-secondary admission terms: fall, winter and spring.
Loyalist College reserves the right to restrict enrolment in a program and/or suspend a program intake
where sufficient enrolment is not attained prior to the start of classes. When Loyalist has taken a
decision to suspend a program to which applicants have been admitted, applicants will be notified in
writing.
5. Domestic Applicants Admission Requirements
Any applicant who attended secondary school in another province or country must provide
