Qualified applicants will be selected to receive an offer of admission based on the following priority:
1. Residents of Ontario
2. Residents of Canada
3. All other applicants
If a program is oversubscribed after the above residency prioritization, qualified applicants will be ranked
according to predetermined, measurable, program-specific criteria.
10. Application Decision
Applications are assessed by Loyalist College’s Enrolment Services, which accepts, declines or defers the
admission of applicants to programs.
Applicants will be advised of Loyalist’s decision in writing by Enrolment Services.
Admission to a Loyalist College program means that a student is only admitted to that program and
specified admit term.
Admission to one program is not a guarantee of admission to another program or of admission to the
same program in a different semester.
