Student Participation in Formal College Activities
1. Introduction and Purpose 
The purpose of this policy is to provide a mechanism to address evaluations missed by students
participating on Varsity Athletics teams, Student Government, the College Board of Governors or other
formal College activities.   
2. Application 
This policy applies to all Loyalist College students engaged in formal College activities. 
