description of the proposed professional development activity. It is the College’s intention to encourage
employees to create works of innovation and discovery. Accordingly, the application for Academic
Professional Development Leave shall also contain a statement, signed by the employee and their
supervisor, which sets out how any net profit from revenue generated by the commercial exploitation of
such professional development activity, shall be shared between the College and the employee. 
