4. Policy Statement 
This policy applies to all international travel and accommodation arrangements arising out of and in the
course of College activities. In all cases, the College retains the authority and responsibility for making
appropriate arrangements and decisions respecting travel, accommodations and insurance requirements.
This function is carried out by authorized College personnel, under this policy, unless otherwise
permitted by an authorized representative of the College. 
5. References 
