Surveys
1. Introduction and Purpose 
Apart from the academic research conducted by Loyalist College faculty, Loyalist participates in a number
of surveys used to gather data from and about Loyalist’s applicants, students, alumni, faculty, staff and
community. The increasing requirement – internally and externally – for gaining information about
stakeholder experiences, and measuring outcomes, has resulted in an ongoing need for
surveys. Analyzing survey results and trending, helps to inform future practices, therefore, it is essential
