3.8.2. Students must be active in a co-operative education program, with an Academic Standing of
Good, or Conditional. A student’s status may not be Probationary or on Academic Suspension.
3.8.2.1. Students who have not completed all required courses for their program of study, may be
eligible to complete their co-op work terms at the discretion of the Senior Vice-President, Academic
(SVPA) in consultation with the Director, CS&WIL.
