7.1.7. Have the option of declining two job offers at which point access to the online co-operative
education placement posting site will be removed for the remainder of that term.
7.1.8. Confirm their employment status and provide the necessary documentation to the Placement
Coordinator by November 1 for a Fall work term, March 1 for aWinter work term, and July 1 for a
Summer work term.
7.1.9. Submit all reports as assigned by their faculty representative. 7.1.10.Submit a completed student
evaluation for each work term to the Placement Coordinator by one week prior to grade due dates
(note that these are not fixed dates, so students will be advised of the actual dates each semester).
For planning purposes, students should expect to submit their evaluations in mid-December for a Fall
