 Financial Administration of Research Funds
1.       Introduction and Purpose
The Tri-Agency Guide on Financial Administration (TAGFA) (the Guide) provides grant recipients and
administering institutions with the principles and directives that govern the post-award administration
of grants funded by the Canadian Institutes of Health Research (CIHR), the Natural Sciences and
Engineering Research Council of Canada (NSERC) and/or the Social Sciences and Humanities Research
Council of Canada (SSHRC).
 
