6.1 Dependant Care
In situations where the claimant incurs expenses above and beyond the usual costs of dependant care,
as a direct result of business travel, costs may be reimbursed using a Tri-Agency funded research
project. In these situations, the claimant may be reimbursed for actual costs up to a daily maximum
of$75/day, which must be supported by receipts. For all other externally funded research projects, the
determination for these expenses will be made based on the funder’s spending guidelines.
 
6.2 Gifts
Gifts may be eligible expenses for Tri-Agency funded projects if specific criteria are met and will be
determined on a case-by-case basis. For example, gifts may be deemed eligible if offered to establish or
facilitate relationships with individuals or groups who participate in research activity as participants or
