An applicant’s indigeneity must be verified prior to employment reference checks and a final offer of
employment being made.
An established Indigenous Citizenship Review Committee whose members are employees of the College
and members of the Indigenous community will verify an applicant’s indigeneity.  If needed and as
appropriate, this Committee may consult with external members of the Indigenous community.
