3.2 Faculty Development 
Loyalist College supports faculty in the pursuit of professional development activities, both within and 
outside of the college, in order to ensure currency of faculty knowledge and promote curricular and 
instructional innovation. 
Faculty may also pursue further academic, professional, or technical education or maintain currency in 
their fields by participating in conferences, meetings, industry placements, job shadowing or 
exchanges.   
