6. Other Roles and Responsibilities
6.1 President
The President is responsible for the overall management and operation of the College. The
President ensures that this policy is implemented, and that compliance is monitored through the
Senior Vice President Academic. The President approves PAC membership in alignment with this
policy and presents PAC recommendations to the Board.
6.2 Deans or Designate
Deans or respective manager, in conjunction with Academic Chairs and Program Coordinators, will
ensure that PAC meetings are held in accordance with this policy and the associated terms of
reference.
7. Related Documents
