industry, government and other relevant organizations.
1. PACs participate in the ongoing review of programs by
Advising on consistency with College direction and Strategic Plan.
Advising on content currency and revitalization, identifying graduate skill profiles necessary for
graduates to be successful.
Reviewing the Annual Quality Assurance and Sustainability Report prepared by the program team and
making recommendations on potential actions.
Providing recommendations to the College on facilities and equipment needs of the program.
Advising on external certifications / micro-credentials as appropriate.
Identifying future directions and potential areas of growth for the specific business, industry or
