Suspension of Operations and Closing of the College
Policy
1. Introduction and Purpose
The safety of our College community – students, employees and visitors – is always a top priority. Loyalist
serves a large service area and conditions can vary widely within the region. Decisions made to close
Loyalist College are made with the safety of its community as its key factor.
The following policy sets out the guidelines for a campus closure due to weather conditions or other
emergencies.
2. Application
This policy applies to the entire college community.
