Advise the Vice-President Corporate Services & Chief Financial Officer of the weather forecast, and
campus and regional conditions.
4. College Closure Decisions
4.1
In the event of an emergency, authorization for suspension of normal operations or closing the College, a
campus or satellite location may only be granted by the President or designate.
4.2
