report for duty unless they are advised by the College that their services are required.
4.3
Should a decision be made for the College to remain open; weather conditions will be monitored
throughout the day. If conditions change that warrant a cancellation of classes for College closure after
6:30 am, these decisions will be made as quickly as possible and communicated. For all other emergency
closures, these decisions will be made as quickly as possible to address health and safety concerns.
4.4
When a decision to close a College building has been made, occupancy or access to the closed building
will be determined at the discretion of the Senior Director of Infrastructure or College Executive Team
(CET).
5. College Closure Notification
