Service & Support Animals on Campus
1.       Introduction and Purpose
Loyalist College is committed to accommodating students and employees and support their health and
well being. The College is also committed to ensuring that visitors with disabilities seeking to access the
College’s public spaces are accorded those rights mandated by the applicable legislation as set out in the
Customer Service Standards of the Accessibility for Ontarians with Disabilities Act, 2005 (“AODA”).
