removed from campus if it is disturbing any campus activities or jeopardizing the health of others. As
with service animals, support animals will not be permitted where food is prepared nor in any area
where the animal’s presence could create a health and safety hazard or compromise operations.
4.3       Service and Support Animals in Residences
Students will be required to complete all necessary documents before bringing the service/support
animal into residence. Loyalist College has a right to refuse residence to a student with a support animal
if there is impact to the health and well-being of others.
5.       Related Documents
Procedure – Service and Support Animals on Campus
Appendix A: Service and Support Animals on Campus – Medical Documentation
