take any reasonable steps to further the objectives of this policy
7.        Providing Net Benefit to Ontarians and Institutional
Engagement with the Innovation Ecosystem
To build institutional capacity to conduct Applied Research and thereby develop and enhance Ontario-
based IP
, the College will continue to build and maintain relationships with local innovation ecosystem
partners such as incubators, accelerators, innovation centres, research networks, without however
