4.       Policy Statement – General Principles
a. Only agencies that have signed agency agreements with, and are certified by, Loyalist College are
authorized to represent and recruit students on Loyalist’s behalf.
b. If there is any conflict or inconsistency between the terms and provisions of this policy and the
agency agreement, the provisions of the agency agreement shall prevail.
5.     Roles and Responsibilities
a. Only agencies that have signed agency agreements with, and are certified by, Loyalist College are
authorized to represent and recruit students on Loyalist’s behalf.
b. If there is any conflict or inconsistency between the terms and provisions of this policy and the
agency agreement, the provisions of the agency agreement shall prevail.
5.1
Loyalist College is responsible for the appointment, certification, training, management, and termination
of agencies.
